   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<br><br>ordered_logistic_rng resturns integers 1,...,K-1 instead of 1,...,K<br><br>Demo (pystan):<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;&#39;&#39;<br>data {<br>    int K;<br>    int N;<br>    int&lt;lower=1,upper=K&gt; y[N];<br>}<br>parameters{<br>    ordered[K-1] c;<br>}<br>model{<br>    for (n in 1:N) y[n]~ ordered_logistic(0.0,c);<br>}<br>generated quantities{<br>    int res;<br>    res &lt;- ordered_logistic_rng(0.0, c);<br>}<br>&#39;&#39;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>smTest</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pystan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">StanModel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model_code</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;K&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;y&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;N&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">len</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>fit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> smTest</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sampling</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">500</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    chains</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">thin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">warmup</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">njobs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>res</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">extract</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()[</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;res&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">):</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;p_%d=%.3f&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">res</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">).</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>c4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">extract</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()[</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;c&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">][:,-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">].</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;p_5=P(y&gt;K-1)=%.3f&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">np</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">exp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(-(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>gives<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">p_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.025</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><div><div><div><pre><span style=\"color:#000\">p_2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.044</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>p_3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.071</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>p_4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.859</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>p_5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>p_5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">P</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.770</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></pre></div></div></div></div></code></div><br>The sampled p_5 is inconsistent with the estimate of c.<br><br>That&#39;s pystan 2.1.0.1<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
